    <bf:custodialHistory>LC copy bears inscriptions on rear paste-down leaf and facing endleaf: "Sii︠a︡ kniga gospodina podpolkovnika Ḟedora Seitovicha Khrushchova." Also bears the inscription "Sii︠a︡ kniga [...] Mikhaila Ivanovicha [...]" on the facing endleaf. Other illegible inscriptions appear on endleaves.</bf:custodialHistory>
